<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-13T09:47:58.204Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:47:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militants continue to target security forces in Jammu and Kashmir, with attacks on CRPF personnel in Kulgam and Kishtwar resulting in injuries to jawans and the death of two police officers, while the chief minister condemned the Kishtwar incident. In Manipur, armed clashes persist, including the killing of a Kuki woman and injuries to two others, and a separate firing that left a woman farmer dead and three men wounded in Kangpokpi district. The NIA has inspected the Kulgam attack site and intensified search operations across the region. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQRHZURTRtREVjTm1qR1VzMXFCOTNpeUlyek1ZalV2MHhTZXBFMkdGS05FZml5YjE0Tm5DQnZkSzg3WjZvNVhCX0h2MVlpVnhUY1poaFRna3FfNTZVMmNsVlU5dW9nUlhuRlZyTjJmcS1BVDFyRW5qcktaVkw5MXoyWGJDU3VDNEt3dE5uUk5rUGRwdjFCV2ZaZXJuRzBIcU1Ydjk4SEdmNmdHYVdHQ1lQNkhCNC1aQkdEQVhWbWln?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNQWlzazMwd3prMG5VVVBkd3JtOWpiWjAzU182c1pBejN1UXZfcGJWa3h2NHN2Vm5IMWpiSzNGLVVRZjY0eXUwLWhZZmlSQmJheTBtN0IwWm15MXZES3NpTUg1QXVfQUtFWm1IWlNNa1g3Y1pjYXBpZmJ6RTJ5UGJYZkE4ZXVuc19fSko5XzVfUkdXTzIxUE5jUUU1LTg0R2U3NjdVeTVCOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQQnhLSVF6NzlYRmlJVW12SktXVU5pQ1ZNVGwzMnhTY2R3NkJJdExVMHlZNnlzOXV5TTVxTkQ5ZkRpUWFpaXVVUlB6QW5QVVZWSzFxal93NWZZY2xrYlhEOXlyT3VoVmdvLUNhdWhGZXppbThlbXFORzdiUFBvZVFPc19hbmZVdmVZTkhMZU1XNlY0QVk2SXVaQkt0UVZObjdVdUNzRDhVUlVLOHdzdkZxMmhTdGdaUzQyQkh3UVR3?oc=5&